# Data Warehouse Layers

## Overview

This folder contains all SQL scripts used to build the Data Warehouse layers.

---

# Completed Work ✅

### 01_Create_Database.sql

This script creates:

- SalesDW database
- Bronze schema
- Silver schema
- Gold schema

---

### 02_Create_Bronze.sql

This script creates all Bronze tables.

### Notes

- All columns are created as `NVARCHAR(MAX)`.
- No Primary Keys.
- No Foreign Keys.

This is intentional because Bronze stores raw data exactly as received from the source.

---

### 03_Load_Bronze.sql

Loads all CSV files into Bronze tables using `BULK INSERT`.

Dataset path used:

D:\Sales_OLAP_Analysis\datasets\

Expected row counts after execution:

| Table | Rows |
|--------|-----:|
| brands | 9 |
| categories | 7 |
| customers | 1445 |
| products | 334 |
| stores | 3 |
| staffs | 10 |
| stocks | 939 |
| orders | 1615 |
| order_items | 4764 |

---

# Next Step (Silver Layer)

The next developer should create:

- 04_Create_Silver.sql
- 05_ETL_Bronze_to_Silver.sql

### Silver Layer Requirements

- Create proper data types.
- Add Primary Keys.
- Clean and transform data.
- Convert data from Bronze to Silver.
- Do NOT modify Bronze tables.

---

# Execution Order

1. 01_Create_Database.sql
2. 02_Create_Bronze.sql
3. 03_Load_Bronze.sql
4. 04_Create_Silver.sql
5. 05_ETL_Bronze_to_Silver.sql
6. 06_Create_Gold.sql
7. 07_ETL_Silver_to_Gold.sql
